  <h2>After the notarization</h2>
  <p>Keep a copy or a clear photo of the notarized pages before you hand them over. If a name is misspelled or a seal is missing, it is easier to fix while the notary is still with you than the next morning. If you used an online session, download the completed file from the provider before you close the tab, and send it the way the recipient requested.</p>
